      "text": "Hidden Among Carrots: Nogales Smuggling Bust\n \nUSBP agents from the Tucson Sector, in partnership with HSI, intercepted a tractor trailer near Nogales, AZ, rescuing 11 illegal aliens concealed among pallets of carrots. The driver, a Mexican citizen here on a visitor visa, faces charges for human smuggling and cabotage violations.\n \nHuman smugglers continue to treat lives as cargo. Agents remain committed to disrupting these operations.\n\n@usbpchieftca\n@hsiarizona",
