      "text": "Crossing illegally comes with consequences—not opportunities.\n\nU.S. Border Patrol Agents are safeguarding our nation’s border around the clock. Those who attempt to enter the United States unlawfully will be detected, apprehended, prosecuted, and deported. In many cases, the destination after removal may not be the one anticipated.\n\nOur laws are being enforced. Our agents are standing watch. The border is CLOSED!\n\n@USBPChiefTCA @USBPChiefRGV @USBPChiefLRT @USBPChiefSDC @CBPAMO",
